    "title": "City of Mills lifts water restrictions - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Tommy Culkin ,\n4 hours ago MILLS, Wyo. — Following a City Council vote at its Tuesday meeting, the City of Mills lifted water restrictions that had been in place since April to combat drought conditions. Previously, residents were limited to watering yards during certain hours and on specific days, with fines for violations. Following... Read full article\n1",
